# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale fil, transcribed
# in chronologia/dayparts.py as the morning band (CLDR morning1 + morning2,
# 00:00-12:00).  Surface: umaga, "morning".  madaling-araw is NOT shipped:
# CLDR fil labels its 06:00-12:00 band with it and its 00:00-06:00 band with
# umaga, which inverts the dictionary senses (madaling-araw is glossed as the
# period between midnight and sunrise), so which band the word names is
# unresolved.  en.wiktionary.org, umaga.
umaga
